# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Direnv
.direnv/

# Nix build output symlink
result

# cargo-about output for nfpm packaging — regenerated by
# `just licenses-html` before each `package-*` build, shipped to
# /usr/share/doc/tisvlay/ inside the .deb/.rpm/.pkg.tar.zst. The
# build-time embed lives in $OUT_DIR (already covered by target/).
/packaging/licensing/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.html
bench-results/

# mdBook build output (docs/book → Read the Docs). The source lives in
# docs/book/src; the rendered site is regenerated by `just docs-build`.
/docs/book/book/

# mdbook-mermaid assets — regenerated by `mdbook-mermaid install docs/book`
# (run by `just docs-build`, CI, and Read the Docs). mermaid.min.js is a
# ~2.6 MB vendored bundle; keep it out of git.
/docs/book/mermaid.min.js
/docs/book/mermaid-init.js
